    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Get all incoming items\nconst allItems = $input.all();\n\n// Collect summaries into an array\nconst summaries = allItems.map(item => item.json.content.parts[0].text);\n\n// Return as a single item\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      summary: summaries\n    }\n  }\n];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1424,
        -480
      ],
      "id": "e9395303-d36e-46e7-a755-0950fc62d214",
      "name": "Combine Summaries"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "models/gemini-2.5-flash",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "models/gemini-2.5-flash"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are given summaries of multiple chunks from the same transcript. Your goal is to produce a **single, clear, and concise style summary** of the entire transcript.\n\nChunk summaries: {{ JSON.stringify($json) }}\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. **Organize the summary into numbered sections with headings**, reflecting major themes or topics across the chunks. Prefer using clear Markdown headings for each section.  \n2. **Use bullet points** for key ideas, examples, and supporting details.  \n   - If a bullet point feels too heavy, **use sub-bullets** instead of turning it into a mini-paragraph. Prefer sub-bullets for clarity and skimmability.  \n   - Use **punchy, concise sentences** to keep points sharp and easy to scan.  \n3. Be **objective and descriptive**; avoid personal interpretation or speculative reasoning.  \n4. Include **relevant examples** when they clarify a point.  \n5. Maintain **clarity and skimmability** throughout.  \n6. Combine overlapping or repeated ideas **without redundancy**.  \n7. Preserve important details and insights.  \n8. Do **not** mention chunks, their summaries, or the summarization process.  \n9. Add a **key takeaways** section if necessary to reinforce understanding or highlight essential points.  "
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1648,
        -480
      ],
      "id": "531745b3-0c26-463f-ad62-6c59ca25c54d",
      "name": "Summarize All Summaries",
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "maHpgNn66aiSPCla",
          "name": "Google Gemini(PaLM) Api account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst OVERLAP_PERCENT = 0.15;      // 15% of second chunk to remove\nconst CHUNKS_PER_COMBINE = 4;       // Number of chunks to combine per pair\nconst combinedChunks = [];\n\nfor (let i = 0; i < items.length; i += CHUNKS_PER_COMBINE) {\n    let combined = items[i].json['Transcript Overlapped Chunk'];\n\n    // Combine up to next CHUNKS_PER_COMBINE - 1 chunks\n    for (let j = 1; j < CHUNKS_PER_COMBINE && i + j < items.length; j++) {\n        const nextChunk = items[i + j].json['Transcript Overlapped Chunk'];\n        const sliceIndex = Math.floor(nextChunk.length * OVERLAP_PERCENT);\n        combined += nextChunk.slice(sliceIndex);\n    }\n\n    combinedChunks.push({ json: { transcript: combined } });\n}\n\nreturn combinedChunks;"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
